#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Nagbago ang node pagkatapos iguhit ang pahina, kaya walang ginawa. Suriin ito at subukang muli."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Hindi pinapayagan ng iyong mga pahintulot sa device ang pagbabago sa talaang ito."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Pangalan: may isa pang fabric na gumagamit na ng pangalang ito."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Adapter: may isa pang fabric na nag-i-sweep na sa adapter port na ito sa poller na ito. Isang fabric lamang bawat adapter port."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Hindi ma-save ang fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Na-save ang fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Kasalukuyang tumatakbo ang pag-sweep ng fabric na ito, kaya walang tinanggal. Subukang muli kapag natapos na ito."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Tinanggal ang fabric at ang imbentaryo nito. Walang Cacti device ang binago at hindi kinontak ang fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Hindi matanggal ang fabric."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Hindi binago ang pagkakakilanlan ng node."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Na-update ang pagkakakilanlan ng node. I-sweep itong muli mula sa susunod na cycle."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Inilipat ang pagmamapa ng device sa bagong node."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Hindi makumpirma ang panukala. Maaaring nagbago na ang mga node mula nang gawin ito."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "Hindi matanggihan ang panukala."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "Tinanggihan ang panukala."

