msgid "No device was created. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Walang device na ginawa. Tingnan ang Cacti log."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Ginawa ang device at inimapa ang node dito. Piliin ang mga port na igagrap sa pahinang New Graphs."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "Hindi mabasa ang imbentaryo para sa pag-export."

