msgid "The Fabric templates and data query file were installed."
msgstr "Na-install ang mga template ng Fabric at ang data query file."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates were not installed. See the Cacti Objects table and the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hindi na-install ang mga template ng Fabric. Tingnan ang talahanayan ng Cacti Objects at ang Cacti log."

