#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "Hindi naka-install ang mga template ng Fabric. I-reinstall ang mga ito mula sa pahina ng kalusugan."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Nakamapa na ang node sa isang device."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Ang fabric ng node ay hindi ini-sweep ng main poller, kaya hindi ma-poll ang device nito."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Hindi umiiral ang device."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Ang device ay pino-poll ng ibang poller kaysa sa nag-i-sweep sa fabric na ito, kaya hindi nito mabasa ang fabric cache."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "Isang device na \"%s\" mula sa template ng device na %s, pangalan ng host na %s, pino-poll ng poller %d, na naka-off ang mga pagsusuri ng availability at SNMP."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Ang data query na %s dito, na naglilista ng mga port ng node. Hindi ito gumagawa ng graph o data source nang mag-isa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Ginawa ng Fabric plugin para sa node na %s. Ang mga halaga nito ay nagmumula sa plugin cache; ang pangalan ng host ay isang nakalaang pangalan na hindi kailanman kinokontak."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Pangalan: gumamit ng 1 hanggang 64 na titik, numero, espasyo, tuldok, gitling, o salungguhit, na nagsisimula sa titik o numero."

